                            <i class="fas fa-copy mr-1"></i>Salin
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <pre id="code-snippet" class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-indigo-300">curl -X GET "@baseUrl/api/tasks?pageSize=10" \
